1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,240
 In the previous lecture, we learned about the planning and reasoning capability of AI agents.

2
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:09,360
 Now, let's go and take a look at the demo.

3
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:16,240
 Now, for this demo, I've created a micro-cool AI agent and everything else pretty much remains the same.

4
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:23,520
 So, just instead of going on a skiing trip, maybe Joe wants to go on a five-day beach vocation.

5
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:29,680
 And from the AI agent capability perspective, I have just kept two functionality.

6
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:36,480
 One, the agent can make a call to the HR system to check the leave balance of the employee.

7
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:43,200
 And second, it can book a hotel room based on the user request.

8
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:47,200
 So, I've just simplified it a little bit so that it's easier to understand.

9
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:50,640
 Now, let's take a look at the questions that we're going to ask.

10
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:52,160
 So, we're going to ask two questions.

11
00:00:52,160 --> 00:01:00,480
 First one, book a hotel room for me employee ID is 2525 and if my leave balance is more than five days,

12
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:05,840
 then book the hotel with following details.

13
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:10,240
 Now, for this question, you can see agent has to do three things.

14
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:16,640
 First, it has to go to the HR system and retrieve the vacation days for this employee.

15
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:23,760
 Then it has to make the decision whether the leave balance is less than or more than five days.

16
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:28,960
 If it is more than five days, then it has to make an API call to the hotel booking site

17
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:31,040
 and book the hotel room.

18
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:35,760
 But if the leave balance is less than five days, then it has to come back and tell the user

19
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:41,520
 that it cannot go ahead and book the hotel because the leave balance is less than five days.

20
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:43,280
 Now, let's go ahead and run this query.

21
00:01:44,080 --> 00:01:47,920
 Now, I'm on the micro cool AI agent that has been built.

22
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:51,120
 So, I have a UI here and let me just pose this question.

23
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:58,720
 Now, before I execute this query, let's take a look at the leave balance table which gives me

24
00:01:58,720 --> 00:02:07,360
 a details about the leave balance for this employee to 5125 and the leave balance is only four days.

25
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:12,960
 So, when I run this query, I should get a response from the agent saying that it cannot book a

26
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:17,120
 hotel room because the leave balance is not more than five.

27
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:19,280
 So, let me just go ahead and run this.

28
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:25,280
 So, now it has come back with the response unfortunate to your leave balance is four days,

29
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:30,640
