 And here are some configuration parameters for the LLM then.

49
00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:59,840
 So, next you can see the text here which determines what is the prompt that will go to the

50
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:02,480
 large language model driving the AI agent.

51
