 So, we are saying you are an agent that can check the leave balance based on employee ID

55
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:21,120
 and book a hotel room and so on.

56
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:26,880
 Then if you scroll down, we are providing it some more guidelines around what are the tools

57
